WEBVTT

00:17:29.704 --> 00:17:32.038
nerves at last awake,

00:17:32.038 --> 00:17:34.204
it was exhilarating,

00:17:34.246 --> 00:17:35.829
a gust of snow.

00:17:37.204 --> 00:17:39.413
But I didn't say these things to Abed.

00:17:40.246 --> 00:17:44.246
I told him only that he had killed
one man, not two.

00:17:45.163 --> 00:17:48.371
I told him the name of that man.

00:17:49.829 --> 00:17:52.246
And then I said, "Goodbye."

00:17:53.288 --> 00:17:54.496
Thank you.

00:17:54.538 --> 00:18:01.246
(Applause)